hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27612","Haddathana Yahya ibn Sa'id, from Muhammad ibn Abi Yahya, he said: My mother narrated to me from Umm Bilal that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: Sacrifice with the jadh'a of sheep, for it is permissible."
"27613","Haddathana Ali ibn Bahr: Haddathana Abu Damrah, he said: Haddathana Muhammad ibn Abi Yahya, freedman of the Aslamis, from his mother, he said: Umm Bilal bint Hilal informed me from her father that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: The jadh'a of sheep suffices as a sacrifice."
